# The groups, and the dual list, with a reach of most of the cell
# (#263, D242, docs/groups-m1.md, Section 5.2), in a cube and in
# a cell with every tilt on its bound that a barostat shrinks from 22 Å to
# about 19.3 Å: at every frame the potential energy of `mdir run` is the sum
# over every image of every pair within the cutoff
# (Inputs/triclinic_reach.py). With a pairlist distance of 17 Å, 0.77 to
# 0.89 of the edge, the lists of the cube that took the nearest image of a
# candidate and the one on the other side of the boundary alone lost pairs
# in 23 of the 79 frames. A reach of more than 0.999 of the least edge is
# refused by the builder, and by the runtime when the barostat takes the
# cell there.
#
# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t/cube %t/dual %t/tilted %t/tilted-dual %t/stop %t/refused
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t/cube mdir GPU GROUPS cube 1.7 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t/dual mdir GPU GROUPS cube 1.7 1.2 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t/tilted mdir GPU GROUPS tilted 1.7 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t/tilted-dual mdir GPU GROUPS tilted 1.7 1.2 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t/stop mdir GPU GROUPS cube 2.0 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=STOP
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t/refused mdir GPU GROUPS tilted 2.3 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=REFUSED

# CHECK:      79 frames, 79 with the reach beyond half of the least of the diagonal
# CHECK-NEXT: half of the least of the diagonal well below the reach
# CHECK-NEXT: frames whose potential is not the sum over all images: 0

# STOP:    mdir run failed: mdir: the barostat has made the cell {{[0-9.]+}} Å along x, less than the pairlist distance over 0.999, 20.0200 Å, below which the groups do not hold every pair

# REFUSED: mdir run failed: mdir: 'pairlist_distance', 23 Å, exceeds 0.999 of the least of a_x, b_y, c_z of the cell, 21.978 Å, the most that the groups take
